    {
      "ordinal": 0,
      "label": "common_2140_announce_01",
      "hash64": "8D4FA18FFBF47258",
      "text": "Damit erwartet uns endlich das große Finale\\ndieses Turniers!\\c\\nMal sehen, welche beiden Kontrahenten um den\\ngroßen Sieg kämpfen werden!",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 60,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE01",
          "args_hex": []
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 1,
      "label": "common_2140_announce_02",
      "hash64": "8D4FA48FFBF47771",
      "text": "Champ [VAR 0x0100(0000)] gegen...",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 6,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0100",
          "args_hex": [
            "0000"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 2,
      "label": "common_2140_announce_03",
      "hash64": "8D4FA38FFBF475BE",
      "text": "...unseren Ehrengast in diesem Turnier,\\nTop-Champ Sagaria!",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 3,
      "label": "common_2140_top_01",
      "hash64": "9A17D96E1A2F590A",
      "text": "Schön, dich zu sehen, Champ [VAR 0x0100(0000)]![VAR 0x0114(0011)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 28,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0100",
          "args_hex": [
            "0000"
          ]
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 33,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0011"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 4,
      "label": "common_2140_top_02",
      "hash64": "9A17D86E1A2F5757",
      "text": "Ich dachte mir schon, dass wir uns im Finale\\ngegenüberstehen würden.[VAR 0x0114(0011)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 68,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0011"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 5,
      "label": "common_2140_top_03",
      "hash64": "9A17D76E1A2F55A4",
      "text": "Wir beide haben so viel Zeit damit verbracht,\\nan unserem Können zu feilen...[VAR 0x0114(0011)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 76,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0011"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 6,
      "label": "common_2140_top_04",
      "hash64": "9A17D66E1A2F53F1",
      "text": "Das hier im finalen Kampf zur Schau zu stellen\\nund das Publikum mitzureißen...[VAR 0x0114(0011)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 78,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0011"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 7,
      "label": "common_2140_top_05",
      "hash64": "9A17D56E1A2F523E",
      "text": "Tja, das kommt meiner idealen Welt erstaunlich\\nnahe![VAR 0x0114(0011)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 52,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0011"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 8,
      "label": "common_2140_top_06",
      "hash64": "9A17D46E1A2F508B",
      "text": "Als Präsidentin der Pokémon-Liga sowie als\\nVorstandsvorsitzende dieser Akademie...[VAR 0x0114(0011)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 82,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0011"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 9,
      "label": "common_2140_top_07",
      "hash64": "9A17D36E1A2F4ED8",
      "text": "...könnte ich gerade nicht zufriedener sein.[VAR 0x0114(0011)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 44,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0011"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 10,
      "label": "common_2140_top_08",
      "hash64": "9A17D26E1A2F4D25",
      "text": "Wenn wir uns gegenseitig zu Höchstleistungen\\ntreiben, dann können wir eine noch größere\\r\\nSynergie erreichen.[VAR 0x0114(0011)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 87,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE00",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 110,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0011"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 11,
      "label": "common_2140_top_09",
      "hash64": "9A17D16E1A2F4B72",
      "text": "Langer Rede kurzer Sinn – lass uns das Publikum\\ndurch ein wahres Kampfspektakel inspirieren![VAR 0x0114(0011)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 92,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0011"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 12,
      "label": "common_2140_top_10",
      "hash64": "9A14D46E1A2D1AB4",
      "text": "Spornen wir sie dazu an, eine bessere Version\\nvon sich selbst zu werden![VAR 0x0114(0011)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
